    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine a place where the line between reality and nightmare fades away. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>The Lethe</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a sanctuary for society's most fragile minds, The Lethe concealed a sinister truth beneath its facade of healing. What was meant to mend the broken was, in reality, a twisted experiment designed to shatter the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>RealEscape</i>, an immersive 3D single-player escape room game, you\u2019ll confront the chilling remnants of this abandoned asylum. Every room tells a story, every shadow whispers a secret, and every step drags you deeper into its horrifying past. Can you unravel the truth and escape, or will you become another victim lost in its endless maze?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Choose to venture alone or team up with friends in multiplayer mode. Work together or face the horrors by yourself\u2014but beware, the asylum is full of surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Room Player and Team Profiles</strong>: Your profile evolves based on your choices and performance, reflecting your escape skills and achievements. Whether solo or with a team, your journey shapes your identity in <strong>The Lethe</strong>\u00a0with 10 player and 4 team profiles to uncover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/e4e729e9bff3efab9e32ff273871e12a.avif?t=1744805700\" width=800 height=956 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles and Mind-Bending Mysteries</strong>: Each room offers a unique challenge, designed to test your wits and nerves. Solve riddles, uncover hidden passages, and decipher cryptic messages that will lead you to your freedom\u2026 or doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/86b267f19a5e01eed4df8001d26be216.poster.avif?t=1744805700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/86b267f19a5e01eed4df8001d26be216.webm?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/86b267f19a5e01eed4df8001d26be216.mp4?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong>: The Lethe constantly shifts as you unravel its darkest secrets. Be prepared for the unexpected \u2013 the deeper you go, the more unpredictable it becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Intriguing Narrative</strong>: Begin your journey as part of a team, but soon discover the true horror of being utterly alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/4174e1b84a3d7dd649d5bdc35655491c.poster.avif?t=1744805700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/4174e1b84a3d7dd649d5bdc35655491c.webm?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/4174e1b84a3d7dd649d5bdc35655491c.mp4?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Challenges</strong>: Explore three distinct rooms, each offering a unique aesthetic, story, and gameplay style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hospital</strong>: A twisted labyrinth of psychological puzzles that will test your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost Mines</strong>: An adventurous trek into forgotten depths filled with hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nightmare Escape</strong>: A frantic race for survival as a terrifying creature hunts you in the dark.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think Outside the Box</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles, utilize objects in unexpected ways, and observe every detail to find your way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lethe is more than a game; it\u2019s an invitation. Do you dare to answer the call?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine a place where the line between reality and nightmare fades away. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>The Lethe</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a sanctuary for society's most fragile minds, The Lethe concealed a sinister truth beneath its facade of healing. What was meant to mend the broken was, in reality, a twisted experiment designed to shatter the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>RealEscape</i>, an immersive 3D single-player escape room game, you\u2019ll confront the chilling remnants of this abandoned asylum. Every room tells a story, every shadow whispers a secret, and every step drags you deeper into its horrifying past. Can you unravel the truth and escape, or will you become another victim lost in its endless maze?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Choose to venture alone or team up with friends in multiplayer mode. Work together or face the horrors by yourself\u2014but beware, the asylum is full of surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Room Player and Team Profiles</strong>: Your profile evolves based on your choices and performance, reflecting your escape skills and achievements. Whether solo or with a team, your journey shapes your identity in <strong>The Lethe</strong>\u00a0with 10 player and 4 team profiles to uncover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/e4e729e9bff3efab9e32ff273871e12a.avif?t=1744805700\" width=800 height=956 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles and Mind-Bending Mysteries</strong>: Each room offers a unique challenge, designed to test your wits and nerves. Solve riddles, uncover hidden passages, and decipher cryptic messages that will lead you to your freedom\u2026 or doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/86b267f19a5e01eed4df8001d26be216.poster.avif?t=1744805700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/86b267f19a5e01eed4df8001d26be216.webm?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/86b267f19a5e01eed4df8001d26be216.mp4?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong>: The Lethe constantly shifts as you unravel its darkest secrets. Be prepared for the unexpected \u2013 the deeper you go, the more unpredictable it becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Intriguing Narrative</strong>: Begin your journey as part of a team, but soon discover the true horror of being utterly alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/4174e1b84a3d7dd649d5bdc35655491c.poster.avif?t=1744805700\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/4174e1b84a3d7dd649d5bdc35655491c.webm?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301090/extras/4174e1b84a3d7dd649d5bdc35655491c.mp4?t=1744805700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Challenges</strong>: Explore three distinct rooms, each offering a unique aesthetic, story, and gameplay style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hospital</strong>: A twisted labyrinth of psychological puzzles that will test your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost Mines</strong>: An adventurous trek into forgotten depths filled with hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nightmare Escape</strong>: A frantic race for survival as a terrifying creature hunts you in the dark.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think Outside the Box</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles, utilize objects in unexpected ways, and observe every detail to find your way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lethe is more than a game; it\u2019s an invitation. Do you dare to answer the call?</p>",
